    "body": "\r\n```\r\nlocal filetype = vim.api.nvim_buf_get_option(0, \"filetype\")\r\n\r\nif filetype == \"NvimTree\" then\r\n  vim.b.minicursorword_disable = true\r\nend\r\n```\r\n\r\nhow to turn off mini.cursor word in nvim tree, I don't understand\r\n",
    "bodyHTML": "<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"local filetype = vim.api.nvim_buf_get_option(0, &quot;filetype&quot;)\n\nif filetype == &quot;NvimTree&quot; then\n  vim.b.minicursorword_disable = true\nend\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">local filetype = vim.api.nvim_buf_get_option(0, \"filetype\")\n\nif filetype == \"NvimTree\" then\n  vim.b.minicursorword_disable = true\nend\n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">how to turn off mini.cursor word in nvim tree, I don't understand</p>",
